async function fetchMainHealth(base?:string){if(!base)return{ok:false,appVersion:'unknown'};try{const response=await fetch(new URL('/api/health',base),{headers:{accept:'application/json'}});if(!response.ok)return{ok:false,appVersion:'unknown'};const data=await response.json() as {ok?:unknown;appVersion?:unknown};return{ok:data.ok===true,appVersion:typeof data.appVersion==='string'&&data.appVersion?data.appVersion:'unknown'}}catch{return{ok:false,appVersion:'unknown'}}}
